tns "IAU Transient Name Server" "IAU / Weizmann Institute" discovery-and-alert-brokers [] "[""discovery"",""classification"",""public-object metadata""]" [] [] poll "HTTPS hourly ZIP CSV" https://www.wis-tns.org/content/tns-getting-started "Hourly delta files explicitly contain public objects" "Authenticated POST API with TNS bot API key and mandatory tns_marker User-Agent; bulk public intake uses released CSV deltas." poll "Rolling 60-second quotas vary by operation; cone searches have a separate lower quota. CTAS must honor returned rate headers." "Follow response pagination and rate headers; do not hard-code a page ceiling. Prefer daily/full/hourly CSV deltas for catalog-scale intake." "Public catalog metadata are retained. Attached spectra or photometry are link-only unless individually rights-cleared; discoverability is not a blanket artifact license." implemented-credentials-required implemented-credentials-required active-returning-data direct True "" "" "" "" "{""classifications"":5489,""designations"":17242}" {} "Object, classification, photometry, and spectrum records can have separate proprietary periods; this adapter deliberately uses only public delta files" 2026-08-29 1.0.0 894fce19bd316b61a52c736ef81c3d8c8d1b2bc5f35d185e78c0a27f451d0ce2
